OL,5,G0232 Tech Life
OL,6,     FCloudy lines in the sky, caused by
OL,7,     Faircraft engines, are called
OL,8,     Fcontrails. They're harmful to the
OL,9,     Fenvironment. Now a project is
OL,10,     Funderway, using AI, to reduce the
OL,11,     Famount generated.
