OL,15,G0306 Outlook
OL,16,     FHermany's search for her
OL,17,     Fmysterious grandad revealed her
OL,18,     Findigenous roots in Tierra del
OL,19,     FFuego. With her daughter, she
OL,20,     Fhelped change Chilean law for a
OL,21,     Fpeople once thought extinct.
